cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Multi-Robot Mining Navigation with MADDPG"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Praharaj
    given-names: Badrikanath
  - family-names: Sreeram
    given-names: M. V.
repository-code: "https://github.com/Badri1401/mining-marl-capstone"
abstract: >-
  A multi-agent reinforcement learning system that trains three autonomous
  differential-drive robots to navigate a GPS-denied underground mining arena
  using MADDPG with centralized critics, decentralized execution, and an
  eight-phase curriculum. Includes a matching ROS 2 / Gazebo simulation.
keywords:
  - reinforcement-learning
  - multi-agent
  - maddpg
  - robotics
  - ros2
  - autonomous-navigation
license: MIT
